ients undergoing surgical hip fracture repair</article-title><source>Transfusion</source><year>2006</year><volume>46</volume><fpage>2192</fpage><lpage>2206</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17176334</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1537-2995.2006.01056.x</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>